{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"景"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"景"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>景</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"的一种"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Grothendieck 将拓扑空间上的"},{"Local":{"url":"层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":"推广为"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"景上的层"}},{"Plain":". <strong>景</strong> (site) 是带有覆盖结构 (又称 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck 拓扑"}},{"Plain":") 的范畴. 正如拓扑空间中的开集可由子开集覆盖, 景规定了其对象何时由一族到它的态射覆盖.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Zariski景","text":"Zariski 景"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷小景","text":"无穷小景"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}